  "number": "15",
  "heading": "Tenure of service of officers and sailors.",
  "chapter": null,
  "order": 15,
  "text": "(1) Every Officer and [1][sailor] shall hold office during the pleasure of the President.\n\n(2) Subject to the provisions of this Act and the regulations made thereunder,\n\n(a) the Central Government may [2][dismiss or] discharge or retire from the naval service any officer or [1][sailor];\n\n(b) the Chief of the Naval Staff or any prescribed officer may [3][dismiss or] discharge from the naval service any [4][sailor].",
